      "content": "it doesn't feel temporary though. that's the thing. i can feel it in my bones that there's nothing left in the well. it's like i saw the top of the mountain, and now i'm just staring at the cliff edge. if i keep trying and failing, i'm just going to turn into a parody of myself. i'd rather just disappear now while i still have some dignity left, rather than live to see myself become a total joke.",
